    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "SETUP + PURPOSE\n\n**Purpose:** Automates outbound prospecting by generating personalized outreach emails, sending them through Gmail, and automatically logging each outreach attempt.\n\n**Setup Required:**\n\n* Connect Gmail credentials\n* Connect Google Sheets credentials\n* Select/create an Outreach Log spreadsheet\n* Configure prospect input data\n* Customize outreach messaging/offer\n* Replace demo email address with production prospect data\n",
        "height": 162,
        "width": 272
      },
      "id": "5a4ee92c-6eec-4a3a-b682-74e822e43492",
      "name": "SETUP + PURPOSE1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -64
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**WHAT IT DOES:**\n\nAutomatically turns prospect data into personalized outbound emails, sends them through Gmail, and records each successful outreach attempt in Google Sheets.\n\n**HOW IT DOES IT:**\n\nManual Trigger → Prospect Data → Personalized Message Generation → Gmail Send → Google Sheets Logging\n\nThe workflow takes the prospect's company, contact, email, pain point, and offer; generates a customized subject and email body; sends the message through Gmail; then logs the date, prospect details, subject, Gmail Message ID, and send status.\n\n**WHY PAY FOR IT:**\n\nEliminates repetitive manual outreach work, creates consistent prospect messaging, prevents outreach activity from going untracked, and provides a scalable foundation for automated sales prospecting. It can be customized for different businesses, offers, lead sources, CRMs, and email platforms.\n\n",
        "height": 288,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        336,
        -192
      ],
      "id": "1f2f019c-3720-4513-b481-ead795ec85df",
      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    }
